{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/925110-looking-for-a-bit-of-creatvity","id":925110,"title":"Looking for a bit of creatvity","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-07-02T17:08:27-07:00","id":925110,"title":"Looking for a bit of creatvity","content":"I found this image online and after looking at it I wanna use it in my world of darkness game but I'm currently trying to figure out what kind of supernatural this character will be. Anyone got any idea's ?<br /> <br /> I've been leaning towards maybe a vampire or giest maybe. <br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://s-media-cache-ak0.pinimg.com/736x/5a/82/2a/5a822aa3f53ff7686388081009171e6e.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-02T17:22:15-07:00","id":925122,"title":"","content":"She's got very bright and angelic wings, which would veer me away from vampire. Changeling isn't out of the question, or even a Beast with an angelic Horror, but I'd lean towards someone possessed by an Angel or something God-Machine related.<br /> <br /> I always liked artifacts, so if I was just going for something off the books I'd have the gun divinely empowering her but also driving her to a determined focus. Sort of like the Imbued from Hunter the Reckoning, but solely through her contact with the gun.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 07-02-2016, 08:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-02T17:28:46-07:00","id":925127,"title":"","content":"Dealing death on invisible wings says Sin-Eater to me. Maybe an angel with a human Cover, not as easily a demon as their forms lose ephemerality and become more tangible and visceral. But an angel of death in what looks like the badlands screams Sin-Eater.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-02T18:03:52-07:00","id":925140,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Stupid Loserman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/925110-looking-for-a-bit-of-creatvity?p=925127#post925127\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Maybe an angel with a human Cover, not as easily a demon as their forms lose ephemerality and become more tangible and visceral.</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean, if there's one thing that God-Machine metaphysics leans on more than most other monster setups, it's how concretized everything is \u2014 there's a reason it fits into the &quot;unhinged conspiracy theorist picking up secret Illuminati transmissions through his dental fillings&quot; brand of weird so readily, to say nothing of basic truisms about Infrastructure.<br /> <br /> That said, maybe it's just the commonality between gunslinger-Wild-West and postapocalyptic wasteland pushing my brain in predictable directions, but I'd be inclined to guess qashmal or other Pyretic being before most other things.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-02T18:17:05-07:00","id":925147,"title":"","content":"Perhaps Princess? As in Princess the Hopeful, this is just her Transformed appearance. The wings could be from Wings of Air charm.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Currently Doing: Siren the Drowning (Fansplat Ressurection) <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/779860-siren-the-surfacing-nwod-abandoned-fangame-resurrection\" target=\"_blank\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...e-resurrection</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9750-saulotthegentle","name":"SaulottheGentle","avatar":"https://foru